#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "J Shop is a clean, fast storefront theme for WooCommerce shops, designed around Thai typography (Prompt and Noto Sans Thai). The home page combines a banner slider, a trust strip, a product category grid and up to five product sections by category, all set up in the Customizer without code. Shoppers get a slide-out mini cart with live quantity and total updates, a free-shipping progress bar, coupons and a two-column checkout, while a shop sidebar keeps product filters close at hand. Supports HPOS and the WooCommerce Cart and Checkout blocks."
msgstr ""

